<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Lion Land 6-mth net up 58 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Lion Land 6-mth net up 58 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		109.65    vs	69.26</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     18.5     vs	11.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		  771.95    vs   1,097.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  112.69    vs	70.42</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less  0.27    vs add   0.51</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Lion Land Bhd. The company is involved in property development and the manufacture of building materials.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-23 8911)</p>
</text>
